## Layout

| Path | Purpose |
| --- | --- |
| `src/index.ts` | Public API |
| `src/cli.ts` | Command-line entry point (Bun runs TypeScript directly, no build step) |
| `src/*.test.ts` | Tests using Bun's built-in runner (`bun:test`) |
| `package.json` | Scripts, and the pinned Bun version (`packageManager`) CI installs |
| `docs/` | Documentation and ADRs |

Type-checking is built in (`bun check`); `make build` compiles a single standalone binary.

## Decisions

Record significant decisions as short ADRs in `docs/adr/` (one file per decision).
